fancontroller (1.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add a native GTK 3 application with Wayland and X11 support.
  * Read hardware information through Linux sysfs and procfs.
  * Apply supported hardware settings using a restricted Polkit helper.
  * Add reproducible Debian package builds and Linux release automation.
  * Name the Linux application XiaoXin Control Center (小新控制中心).
  * Add compact CPU, memory, GPU and temperature history charts.
  * Reuse a private privileged helper for each graphical application session.

